OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-seven people have been killed
OL,7,Fand almost 400 evacuated after a
OL,8,FRussian drone strike triggered
OL,9,Fexplosions at a warehouse in the Kyiv
OL,10,Fregion late on Friday.
OL,12,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,13,Fblast damaged residential buildings and
OL,14,Fa care home in the surrounding area as
OL,15,Fprosecutors opened an investigation
OL,16,Finto the "legality of the placement and
OL,17,Fstorage of explosive objects" on site.
OL,19,FZelensky wrote on X: "Ammunition must
OL,20,Fnot be stored near houses or other
OL,21,Fresidential buildings. Appropriate
OL,22,Fconclusions will certainly be drawn."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
